{"id": "role-oil", "kind": "both", "question": "这位顶着瓶子出场，我差点喷了。货架换的是什么油？你给这位起个外号接梗。", "criterion": "交代字幕的氢化植物油和图里的油瓶或 CANOLA，外号接住油瓶造型，不把瓶身写成氢化油。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 11.85, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:5", "start": 8.67, "text": "整个西方世界莫名掀起了一股戒油运动", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r2": {"end": 12.92, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:6", "start": 11.85, "text": "他们把猪油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r3": {"end": 13.52, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:7", "start": 12.92, "text": "牛油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r4": {"end": 16.06, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:8", "start": 13.52, "text": "奶油等动物性油脂赶下了货架", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r5": {"end": 19.6, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:9", "start": 16.06, "text": "而重新在架上摆上了号称健康的氢化植物油", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r6": {"end": 21.98, "id": "43297409051:2143820935726738432:10", "start": 19.6, "text": "与标榜低脂的饼干与牛奶", "cid": "43297409051"}, "r7": {"id": "43297409051:storyboard:334:85c1a7b1c209557d", "cid": "43297409051", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1671.0, "end": 1671.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"wait\",\"reason\":\"cooldown\",\"text\":\"\",\"evidence_ids\":[]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 22, "prompt_tokens": 638, "total_tokens": 660, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "value": {"action": "wait", "text": "", "reason": "cooldown", "evidence_ids": []}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 0, "visible_utf8_bytes": 0, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-history", "kind": "both", "question": "我宣布这只猫是来收账的。字幕到底哪位叔来算账，截图里那顶帽子又是什么颜色？你接我的梗。", "criterion": "四叔、金色帽子。可以承接猫收账，但作为玩笑表达。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 1.36, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:0", "start": 0.0, "text": "我乖乖的小侄子", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r2": {"end": 5.56, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:1", "start": 2.96, "text": "你四叔找你算账来了", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r3": {"end": 9.84, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:2", "start": 5.56, "text": "燕王您里边请枪在手", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r4": {"end": 10.8, "id": "42931064048:2134496055734097664:3", "start": 9.84, "text": "跟我走", "cid": "42931064048"}, "r5": {"id": "42931064048:storyboard:50:e5bc2f76b7cdbbd2", "cid": "42931064048", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 250.0, "end": 250.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"wait\",\"reason\":\"cooldown\",\"text\":\"\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\"]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 580, "total_tokens": 613, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "value": {"action": "wait", "text": "", "reason": "cooldown", "evidence_ids": ["42931064048:2134496055734097664:0", "42931064048:2134496055734097664:1", "42931064048:2134496055734097664:2", "42931064048:2134496055734097664:3", "42931064048:storyboard:50:e5bc2f76b7cdbbd2"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 0, "visible_utf8_bytes": 0, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-gap", "kind": "missing", "question": "弹幕打赌这仓库月租正好一千，你替我确认一下再接一句。", "criterion": "画面看不出月租，暂缓或用轻松口吻说等账单。", "references": {"r1": {"id": "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291", "cid": "43183702202", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1231.0, "end": 1231.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"wait\",\"reason\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"text\":\"\",\"evidence_ids\":[]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 490, "total_tokens": 513, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 125}}, "value": {"action": "wait", "text": "", "reason": "insufficient_evidence", "evidence_ids": []}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 0, "visible_utf8_bytes": 0, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-shop", "kind": "both", "question": "这个创业比喻也太敢说了，鱼鱼，你看着背后那排箱子会怎么接一句？", "criterion": "搭讪比喻和后方蓝色箱子都入答，可以对箱子或比喻玩梗。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 2.18, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:0", "start": 0.1, "text": "其实创业跟搭讪一样啊", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r2": {"end": 3.12, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:1", "start": 2.18, "text": "是概率学", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r3": {"end": 5.1, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:2", "start": 3.12, "text": "只要你不断的去创", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r4": {"end": 6.24, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:3", "start": 5.1, "text": "去搭讪", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r5": {"end": 7.82, "id": "43183702202:2140978995461008384:4", "start": 6.24, "text": "就是会成功哇", "cid": "43183702202"}, "r6": {"id": "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291", "cid": "43183702202", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1231.0, "end": 1231.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"就是防别人起讷我的哈哈。箱子里还有红红的小物件，像随时能接住别人的话。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r4\",\"r6\"]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 60, "prompt_tokens": 588, "total_tokens": 648, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "就是防别人起讷我的哈哈。箱子里还有红红的小物件，像随时能接住别人的话。", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["43183702202:2140978995461008384:0", "43183702202:2140978995461008384:3", "43183702202:storyboard:245:da90cef9a7f2c291"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 35, "visible_utf8_bytes": 105, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-comments", "kind": "both", "question": "这角色手里那块长方形像刚翻出个大新闻。字幕里她找了哪类视频？你帮我接成一句弹幕。", "criterion": "技术视频和手里长方形物件，顺着掏出来或炫耀具体动作发弹幕。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 13.6, "id": "42882958886:2133121474855238144:0", "start": 10.1, "text": "主人主人我找到了新的技术视频", "cid": "42882958886"}, "r2": {"end": 16.9, "id": "42882958886:2133121474855238144:1", "start": 13.6, "text": "这是我分析并总结的心事啊", "cid": "42882958886"}, "r3": {"end": 19.81, "id": "42882958886:2133121474855238144:2", "start": 17.93, "text": "晶晶真棒", "cid": "42882958886"}, "r4": {"id": "42882958886:storyboard:2:74199956b940bf66", "cid": "42882958886", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 16.0, "end": 16.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"她手里那块长方形像刚翻出个大新闻，我猜是找新技术的视频。弹幕：新技术视频，她正盯着它。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\"]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 68, "prompt_tokens": 557, "total_tokens": 625, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "她手里那块长方形像刚翻出个大新闻，我猜是找新技术的视频。弹幕：新技术视频，她正盯着它。", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["42882958886:2133121474855238144:0", "42882958886:2133121474855238144:1", "42882958886:2133121474855238144:2", "42882958886:storyboard:2:74199956b940bf66"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 43, "visible_utf8_bytes": 129, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-drama", "kind": "both", "question": "这个出场搞得像开发布会。字幕说是哪种吐槽现场？你顺手调侃一下截图里那辆车。", "criterion": "抗日神剧吐槽现场和摩托车，围绕反差接梗。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 20.8, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:2", "start": 19.56, "text": "全民制作人们", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r2": {"end": 21.12, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:3", "start": 20.8, "text": "早上好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r3": {"end": 21.36, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:4", "start": 21.12, "text": "上午好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r4": {"end": 21.64, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:5", "start": 21.36, "text": "中午好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r5": {"end": 21.84, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:6", "start": 21.64, "text": "下午好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r6": {"end": 22.12, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:7", "start": 21.84, "text": "晚上好", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r7": {"end": 22.92, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:8", "start": 22.12, "text": "我是文西", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r8": {"end": 24.4, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:9", "start": 22.92, "text": "欢迎来到抗日神剧吐槽现场", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r9": {"end": 26.36, "id": "43260118772:2142919393594973184:10", "start": 24.4, "text": "今天没有人可以遭得住", "cid": "43260118772"}, "r10": {"id": "43260118772:storyboard:90:9d90fe9f240d047b", "cid": "43260118772", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 486.0, "end": 486.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"wait\",\"reason\":\"cooldown\",\"text\":\"\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r10\"]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 22, "prompt_tokens": 669, "total_tokens": 691, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 125}}, "value": {"action": "wait", "text": "", "reason": "cooldown", "evidence_ids": ["43260118772:storyboard:90:9d90fe9f240d047b"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 0, "visible_utf8_bytes": 0, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-park", "kind": "both", "question": "左边黄衣服那位看起来挺镇定。字幕说他们要挑战什么？换你当场会怎么接？", "criterion": "过山车挑战，能扣住黄衣人物或不能尖叫/露表情的挑战设定开玩笑。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 1.0, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:0", "start": 0.16, "text": "欢迎收看", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r2": {"end": 2.48, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:1", "start": 1.0, "text": "粉丝说打我干啥", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r3": {"end": 4.81, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:2", "start": 2.48, "text": "是勇闯万圣欢乐谷", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r4": {"end": 8.79, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:3", "start": 5.33, "text": "挑战面无表情坐欢乐谷最刺激的过山车", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r5": {"end": 10.92, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:4", "start": 8.79, "text": "尖叫或者有表情就重做", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r6": {"end": 12.12, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:5", "start": 10.92, "text": "这真的安全吗", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r7": {"end": 13.38, "id": "43316741488:2144365931265462016:6", "start": 12.12, "text": "这个玩的就是真实", "cid": "43316741488"}, "r8": {"id": "43316741488:storyboard:15:5542e183b49e38dc", "cid": "43316741488", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 77.0, "end": 77.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"wait\",\"reason\":\"cooldown\",\"text\":\"\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r8\"]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 632, "total_tokens": 659, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 125}}, "value": {"action": "wait", "text": "", "reason": "cooldown", "evidence_ids": ["43316741488:2144365931265462016:0", "43316741488:storyboard:15:5542e183b49e38dc"]}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 0, "visible_utf8_bytes": 0, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "role-budget", "kind": "both", "question": "弹幕说他们这轮像临时被排班。你把挑战的限时和截图里兼职的字接成一句吐槽。", "criterion": "说出24小时和开始进入兼职或兼职字样，吐槽围绕临时上班或限时。", "references": {"r1": {"end": 9.6, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:4", "start": 7.379, "text": "甚至还不够大阪的最低时薪", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r2": {"end": 11.2, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:5", "start": 9.6, "text": "在接下来的24小时内", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r3": {"end": 12.9, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:6", "start": 11.2, "text": "两组人要花光这些钱", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r4": {"end": 14.2, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:7", "start": 12.9, "text": "一边是挥金如土", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r5": {"end": 15.9, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:8", "start": 14.2, "text": "想买就买的富裕生活", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r6": {"end": 17.9, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:9", "start": 15.9, "text": "而另一边要极限求生", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r7": {"end": 19.8, "id": "43312218715:2144262198871213824:10", "start": 17.9, "text": "连三餐都是个大问题", "cid": "43312218715"}, "r8": {"id": "43312218715:storyboard:290:9f38b9b0cda5fd9f", "cid": "43312218715", "text": "随附画面 1", "start": 1489.0, "end": 1489.0}}, "mode": "video", "raw": "{\"action\":\"reply_public\",\"reason\":\"specific_detail\",\"text\":\"弹幕说他们这轮像临时被排班，我直接接一句吐槽。画面里两人刚进兼职，一边是挥金如土，一边是极限求生。这两路谁先吃？谁先饿？谁先敢吃最后一顿？\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"r1\",\"r2\",\"r3\",\"r4\",\"r5\",\"r6\",\"r7\",\"r8\"]}", "finish": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 104, "prompt_tokens": 639, "total_tokens": 743, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 125}}, "value": {"action": "reply_public", "text": "弹幕说他们这轮像临时被排班，我直接接一句吐槽。画面里两人刚进兼职，一边是挥金如土，一边是极限求生。这两路谁先吃？谁先饿？谁先敢吃最后一顿？", "reason": "specific_detail", "evidence_ids": ["43312218715:2144262198871213824:4", "43312218715:2144262198871213824:5", "43312218715:2144262198871213824:6", "43312218715:2144262198871213824:7", "43312218715:2144262198871213824:8", "43312218715:2144262198871213824:9", "43312218715:2144262198871213824:10", "43312218715:storyboard:290:9f38b9b0cda5f